# One lazy assertion template must specialize independently at each call.

```catala
declaration scope NonzeroPredicate:
  input amount content integer
  output result content boolean

scope NonzeroPredicate:
  assertion amount != 0
  definition result equals if amount = 0 then false else true

declaration scope RefinedInstances:
  input x content integer
  output result content boolean

scope RefinedInstances:
  definition result equals
    (output of NonzeroPredicate with { -- amount: x }).result
    and not (output of NonzeroPredicate with { -- amount: x + 1 }).result
```
